void msFreeProjection(projectionObj *p)
{
#if PROJ_VERSION_MAJOR >= 6
  proj_destroy(p->proj);
  p->proj = NULL;
  msProjectionContextUnref(p->proj_ctx);
  p->proj_ctx = NULL;
#else
  ...
#endif

  p->gt.need_geotransform = MS_FALSE;
  p->wellknownprojection = wkp_none;
  msFreeCharArray(p->args, p->numargs);
  p->args = NULL;
  p->numargs = 0;
}
```

The READ 8 could be reading `p->proj` or `p->proj_ctx` or `p->args` or `p->numargs`. If `p` itself is a dangling pointer (already freed), then reading any field is a UAF.

